# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers, and several are bind-mounted
# straight from this Windows checkout (rl_agent/ -> /python_ws/src). A CRLF
# line ending makes bash fail on the shebang with a bare "\r" error that
# reads like the file is missing. Keep them LF on checkout whatever the
# local core.autocrlf is set to.
*.sh text eol=lf
